{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"赞比亚","country_iso":"ZMB","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:54:53.052790","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"ZMB-HB-0007","ldc":"Yes","location":"","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"赞比亚工业园零外购电绿能低碳项目","project_name_en":"Zambia Industrial Park Zero Grid-Purchased Power Green and Low-Carbon Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"中材节能","content":"近日，中材节能与天山材料股份有限公司所属Mpande Limestone Limited（以下简称“Mpande公司”）签署了中国建材赞比亚工业园零外购电绿能低碳项目的相关合同。中材节能国际投资有限公司董事长、总经理左大勇，Mpande公司董事长、总经理邵明珠代表双方签署合同。\n该项目充分利用园区内生产线的废气余热以及当地良好的太阳能资源，采用“余热发电+光伏发电”的模式，为赞比亚工业园提供绿色、低碳电力，以解决园区电力供应不稳定、用能成本高昂等问题，推动企业用能向绿色、低碳、可持续转型。项目建成后，年均可供应绿电1.1亿度，将覆盖整个园区用电，折合年均节约标煤约 3.19 万吨，减少二氧化碳排放 6.24 万吨。\n作为专业的绿能环保综合服务商，一直以来，中材节能始终致力于通过加大在绿色能源领域的资金和技术投入，构建多元化清洁能源供应体系，不断优化智能化控制系统在项目上的应用，为“双碳”目标的实现持续贡献中材节能的智慧和力量。","content_sha256":"af568d269d3cd7cb4777137618bd5ee462a462059a68944afcd8373407153563","id":4288,"publish_date":"2025-03-27 18:47:12","title":"中材节能与Mpande公司签署中国建材赞比亚工业园零外购电绿能低碳项目的合同","title_sha256":"83e63e31d257fcb078b0ded49923608ee08880323d82478d79ca9ccb20e9fb51","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/80661.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"ZMB-HB-0007","capacity_details":"余热发电+光伏发电","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:54:53.053176","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"ZMB-HB-0007-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.cnbm.com.cn/CNBM/000000020006/65961.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"Mpande Limest